Suggestions for timing with MMGPS

a) Script for preparing TOAs
b) Script for running automated phase connection routines
c) Script for automated refolding of all data using a parameter/ephemeris file (https://github.com/vishnubk/mmgps_pulsar_followup)
d) Script for getting estimates of different binary parameters using a par file or known input parameters (https://github.com/mcbernadich/CandyCracker)
e) Script for polarisation analysis
